<title>UK: Highland Distilleries lift H1 profits.</title>
<headline>Highland Distilleries lift H1 profits.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to February 28, 1997.</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		12.5		   vs 12.0</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.1		    vs 2.0</p>
<p> Pretax		     24.9		   vs 22.2</p>
<p> Turnover		   110.1		  vs 101.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits of around 22.5 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Highland Distilleries Co Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
